{"id":"84dd19b51f9321f2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/552_解释性逻辑_ILW.md","title":"552 解释性逻辑 ILW","display":"552_解释性逻辑_ILW","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p)\">\\(p=\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=\\operatorname{bot}\">\\(\\bot=\\operatorname{bot}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\">\\(A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B)\\)</span>。定义派生记号</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\triangleright B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(A\\triangleright B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{552}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{552}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>按下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{552}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{552}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{552}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{552}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{552}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,552}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,552}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{552}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{552}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{552})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{552}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{552}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A)\\triangleright\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A\\triangleright B)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,A)\\triangleright\\operatorname{Sub}_{552}(\\sigma,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{552}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{552}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{552}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{552}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{552}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{552}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{552}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{552}\n=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(A\\triangleright B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{552}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{552}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright B)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to(A\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{552}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{552}\n=\n\\{((A\\triangleright C)\\land(B\\triangleright C))\\to((A\\lor B)\\triangleright C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(\\Diamond A\\to\\Diamond B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{552}\n=\n\\{\\Diamond A\\triangleright A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>弱性公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(A\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box\\neg A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}^{552}\n=\n\\{(A\\triangleright B)\\to(A\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box\\neg A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{552}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}^{552}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{552}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{J1}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J2}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J3}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J4}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{J5}^{552}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{W}^{552}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示形式、载体类型与总关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{552}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{552}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Nec 只作用于空依赖行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{552}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{552}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{552}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{552}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{552}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{552}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{552}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{552}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{552}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{552}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{552}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{552}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{552}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{552}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的特征是弱性公理</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\triangleright B)\\to(A\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box\\neg A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\triangleright B)\\to(A\\triangleright(B\\land\\Box\\neg A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ILM\">\\(ILM\\)</span> 的保 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span> 公理和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ILP\">\\(ILP\\)</span> 的持久化公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ILW}_{552}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{552},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{552},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,552},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{552},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{552},\n\\vdash_{552},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{552}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ILW}_{552}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{552},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{552},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{552},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,552},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{552},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{552},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{552},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{552},\n\\vdash_{552},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{552}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含解释性模态句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含框架语义、算术解释或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{552}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{int}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=\\operatorname{bot}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\triangleright B=\\operatorname{int}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Box A:=(\\neg A)\\triangleright\\bot,\n\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.","display":tr